WEBVTT

00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:06.260
Anthony decided to take Candy
to his own home...

00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:10.797
...in order to save her from the
torment of the Leagan family.

00:00:12.493 --> 00:00:17.944
However, Eliza managed to ruin
his efforts.

00:00:22.841 --> 00:00:29.577
Springtime wind on
the big tree.

00:00:30.648 --> 00:00:35.463
In that moment, mr. Leagan, who
was absent for a lenghty period of time,

00:00:35.498 --> 00:00:38.092
...finally returned to his estate.

00:00:44.278 --> 00:00:46.184
Welcome back.

00:00:48.931 --> 00:00:52.270
Hello. Ruth, you're
the same as always.

00:00:52.461 --> 00:00:54.057
Yes.

00:00:54.818 --> 00:00:57.160
What happened to Candy?

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:03.893
Why are you wearing that apron?

00:01:06.721 --> 00:01:09.243
Darling, I want to talk about
that in private.

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:19.354
What? Candy has...?

00:01:20.011 --> 00:01:23.827
She's violent, selfish and
totally unmanageable!

00:01:25.626 --> 00:01:29.437
Unless we get rid of that girl,
she will bring shame to our family!

00:01:29.493 --> 00:01:30.699
Right, Brother?

00:01:31.318 --> 00:01:32.952
I can't put up with it anymore!

00:01:33.331 --> 00:01:35.328
Call her to my study!

00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:37.571
Yes!

00:01:40.481 --> 00:01:42.284
She's finally gonna get some!

00:01:50.873 --> 00:01:54.412
To pack my suitcases...
Am I fired?

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:56.253
It's your day off!

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:58.574
Day off?
But...

00:01:59.492 --> 00:02:02.323
Everybody needs a day off
once in a while.

00:02:03.384 --> 00:02:07.799
I thought you might want to
visit your Pony's home, Candy.

00:02:09.531 --> 00:02:10.811
Then...!

00:02:11.513 --> 00:02:14.465
I want you to get your
stamina back.

00:02:14.675 --> 00:02:16.146
I will.

00:02:21.006 --> 00:02:23.114
My dear Pony's hill.

00:02:35.143 --> 00:02:37.207
The engine sounds good today!

00:02:37.242 --> 00:02:41.065
It's been running for ten minutes
already and hasn't blown out yet.

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.700
Huh? Candy?

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:55.413
Hey! Candy!

00:02:57.228 --> 00:02:58.947
Damn!

00:03:04.047 --> 00:03:06.001
What? Candy has..?

00:03:06.036 --> 00:03:07.474
That's right!

00:03:07.768 --> 00:03:10.327
Why didn't you go after them, brother?

00:03:10.362 --> 00:03:14.533
You know that my car tends to
break down at important times!

00:03:18.254 --> 00:03:20.493
Hey, Anthony! Candy has...!

00:03:22.504 --> 00:03:24.101
I came to tell you good news.

00:03:24.102 --> 00:03:24.798
Huh?

00:03:24.833 --> 00:03:26.973
Anthony, what happened to Candy?

00:03:28.144 --> 00:03:31.783
Mr. Leagan returned today,
so Candy will be okay from now on.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.645
Where was she going, Anthony?

00:03:34.845 --> 00:03:36.949
On a refreshing journey.

00:03:45.276 --> 00:03:51.749
(This text has nothing to do with the anime.)

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:17.038
Mr. Matthew!

00:04:17.839 --> 00:04:19.856
Mr. Matthew, hello!

00:04:22.401 --> 00:04:24.245
Oh, Candy!

00:04:25.487 --> 00:04:29.340
You can drop me off here, mr. Steyn!
I'll walk the rest.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.054
Thank you very much.

00:04:31.089 --> 00:04:31.837
Candy!

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:35.508
Why did you return?

00:04:38.207 --> 00:04:40.526
Uh, well...

00:04:40.974 --> 00:04:44.457
You think they kicked
me out, right?

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.921
Uh, no...

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:48.789
Am I wrong?

00:05:14.185 --> 00:05:17.957
It hasn't changed at all!
It's so beautiful.

00:05:22.510 --> 00:05:24.850
I'm back. At the Pony's home.

00:05:24.851 --> 00:05:26.223
And the Pony's hill.

00:05:26.438 --> 00:05:28.602
I'm home!

00:05:29.249 --> 00:05:32.370
I'm home!!

00:05:33.046 --> 00:05:34.854
Huh? It's Candy's voice!

00:05:34.889 --> 00:05:37.115
-What?
-Candy?

00:05:39.311 --> 00:05:41.100
I'm back, everyone!

00:05:44.415 --> 00:05:46.507
John, Sam, Milly!

00:05:54.908 --> 00:05:58.308
Candy!
Sister Pony, it's Candy!

00:05:58.614 --> 00:06:00.472
Don't tell me that Candy...

00:06:11.588 --> 00:06:17.558
Don't worry, Candy just came
back for the holidays.

00:06:18.198 --> 00:06:19.397
My...

00:06:19.818 --> 00:06:21.036
Candy!

00:06:21.574 --> 00:06:23.780
Alright, I'll be on my way.

00:06:23.815 --> 00:06:27.106
Uh, mr. Matthew, are there
any letters?

00:06:27.692 --> 00:06:31.124
You mustn't forget about
all those important letters!

00:06:32.437 --> 00:06:36.313
Today I have no mail for Pony's home.

00:06:38.795 --> 00:06:40.473
Well then, excuse me.

00:06:42.889 --> 00:06:47.679
Candy, I'm sure he came just
to see you off.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:48.863
That's it.

00:06:49.805 --> 00:06:53.385
Thank you, mr. Matthew!
Goodbye!

00:06:55.265 --> 00:06:59.538
It's so nice, being in Pony's home.
It feels like my home, after all.

00:07:01.248 --> 00:07:04.223
Sister Pony, sister Lane,
I'm back.

00:07:04.297 --> 00:07:06.704
Welcome back, Candy.

00:07:07.207 --> 00:07:09.116
Let's play, Candy!

00:07:09.716 --> 00:07:11.769
Let's play, let's play!
Okay!

00:07:12.224 --> 00:07:14.238
Everybody, let's climb a tree!

00:07:14.273 --> 00:07:16.261
Don't do that, Candy!

00:07:30.904 --> 00:07:32.585
"To be cut down."

00:07:33.334 --> 00:07:34.955
This is...

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:51.218
They plan to relocate that tree.

00:07:51.253 --> 00:07:53.096
That's impossible!

00:07:53.934 --> 00:07:58.687
We were against it, but this land is
mr. Cartwright's property.

00:07:59.076 --> 00:08:04.546
Mr. Cartwright is rich and he
wants that tree.

00:08:04.967 --> 00:08:08.758
If that tree disappears from Pony's home...

00:08:10.284 --> 00:08:14.692
My memories of that tree
come all the way to the beginning.

00:08:19.053 --> 00:08:22.293
When I fell from it while
rescuing little birds...

00:08:22.813 --> 00:08:25.407
When I watched my friend Annie leave...

00:08:25.641 --> 00:08:27.057
I was on that tree.

00:08:28.912 --> 00:08:32.411
I will beg mr. Cartwright.

00:08:32.521 --> 00:08:36.699
Mr. Cartwright is in a
foreign country right now.

00:08:36.734 --> 00:08:39.642
I won't be able to wait for
him until he comes back!

00:08:39.677 --> 00:08:42.246
And this matter is urgent.

00:08:42.352 --> 00:08:43.892
Teacher!

00:08:43.927 --> 00:08:45.276
Teacher!

00:08:45.733 --> 00:08:47.923
Big trouble! The tree is...!

00:09:00.791 --> 00:09:03.522
This is bad!
John, gather everybody!

00:09:04.348 --> 00:09:06.986
Candy! Don't do anything violent!

00:09:13.887 --> 00:09:15.912
You! What are you doing?

00:09:17.755 --> 00:09:21.070
Climb it, climb it!

00:09:30.641 --> 00:09:33.401
Hey! Don't climb up there!
Stop it!

00:09:37.061 --> 00:09:39.654
You're gonna fall!
Stop that!

00:09:41.951 --> 00:09:43.466
-Hey, you!
-Pervert!

00:09:47.043 --> 00:09:49.187
Hey! Come down!

00:09:49.934 --> 00:09:51.787
What are you doing? Come down!

00:09:52.125 --> 00:09:55.012
Candy!
Don't do anything stupid!

00:09:55.389 --> 00:09:57.396
It's them who are stupid!

00:09:57.666 --> 00:10:00.372
Shut up! I'm gonna get you for this!

00:10:00.783 --> 00:10:02.328
It's mr. Flanneman!

00:10:08.946 --> 00:10:10.080
Mr. Flanneman!

00:10:12.714 --> 00:10:14.308
What's all this fuss about?

00:10:14.343 --> 00:10:17.596
As you can see, these kids
are opposing us.

00:10:17.631 --> 00:10:20.684
-This is our tree!
-We're not gonna give it to anyone!

00:10:20.719 --> 00:10:23.382
-You won't take it!
-It's not yours!

00:10:23.746 --> 00:10:28.168
This tree was bought by
mr. Flanneman! Get down now!

00:10:28.203 --> 00:10:33.130
You idiot! What are you loitering about?
Move it!

00:10:38.655 --> 00:10:41.656
*Denjin Anime Fansub*

00:10:42.165 --> 00:10:48.742
Alright!
One, two, three...

00:10:51.185 --> 00:10:53.478
Algight, I'm gonna get naughty!

00:10:59.285 --> 00:11:04.167
Hey! This is my tree! If you don't get
down, I'm gonna drag you down myself!

00:11:04.488 --> 00:11:09.140
Everybody, come down! Mr. Flanneman,
please don't do anything to children!

00:11:13.826 --> 00:11:15.808
Candy, come down!

00:11:16.196 --> 00:11:18.895
I won't give up so easily!

00:11:19.954 --> 00:11:24.383
Alright then! I'm good at
climbing trees, too!

00:11:36.892 --> 00:11:38.638
I got you now.

00:11:40.044 --> 00:11:41.129
It's pointless!

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:45.179
If you come any closer,
I'm going to jump down!

00:11:45.389 --> 00:11:47.580
Oh, you're a lively young lady.

00:11:48.174 --> 00:11:49.872
Well, I'll have a smoke.

00:11:56.528 --> 00:11:58.886
I'm Flanneman.

00:11:58.921 --> 00:12:01.017
President of the Washington-based
company.

00:12:03.322 --> 00:12:08.172
Though you're a president of the company,
you have no right to take our tree!

00:12:09.914 --> 00:12:12.511
Actually, my hobby is tree-climbing.

00:12:13.162 --> 00:12:15.936
Ever since I was a little boy,
I've had a keen eye for good trees.

00:12:16.394 --> 00:12:23.034
So I've gathered trees good for climbing
from all over the world in my garden.

00:12:23.445 --> 00:12:27.254
I've been making all of my business
decisions while sitting atop a tree.

00:12:28.583 --> 00:12:33.055
If you already have so many trees, you
don't have to take this one, too!

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:36.440
No, I was charmed by this tree.

00:12:36.475 --> 00:12:41.856
It's shape is great, it's good for
climbing, it's a best tree in America!

00:12:42.274 --> 00:12:45.205
This tree is beautiful because it's
growing on this hill.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:49.318
If you take it to your garden,
it will lose its charm!

00:12:50.428 --> 00:12:53.489
Are you saying that it will
lose its character?

00:12:53.524 --> 00:12:57.385
And besides, the tree will dry out
before you get it to your garden!

00:12:57.420 --> 00:13:00.583
Don't worry. I hauled trees from
even further places.

00:13:01.357 --> 00:13:04.407
Anyway, we are strongly
against this!

00:13:04.665 --> 00:13:09.496
That's right! We're
against this!

00:13:11.821 --> 00:13:12.958
Shut up!

00:13:13.742 --> 00:13:15.622
Be quiet!

00:13:16.659 --> 00:13:22.614
If you won't let me move this tree, then I'll
have to come from Washington just to climb it.

00:13:22.959 --> 00:13:25.283
Really, mr. Flanneman?

00:13:25.318 --> 00:13:29.240
And I guess I'll have to build myself
a villa, right there.

00:13:33.994 --> 00:13:35.958
You'd tear down Pony's home...?

00:13:36.043 --> 00:13:41.438
You can choose; either we move this
tree, or we tear down that building.

00:13:51.813 --> 00:13:54.913
Candy, let's give up on that tree.

00:13:55.367 --> 00:13:59.060
Like mr. Flanneman said, once a man
wishes for something, he will do

00:13:59.061 --> 00:14:01.578
...anything in his power to obtain it.

00:14:07.948 --> 00:14:10.473
The tree is crying.

00:14:11.291 --> 00:14:13.378
It doesn't want to go anywhere.

00:14:19.682 --> 00:14:22.479
You, too, like Pony's home?

00:14:22.648 --> 00:14:24.663
You want to stay here forever?

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:34.283
A dry leaf.

00:14:35.337 --> 00:14:37.436
That's it! I have a good idea!

00:14:42.144 --> 00:14:44.989
-Candy!
-Candy!

00:14:50.558 --> 00:14:52.244
Ca... Candy!

00:14:52.738 --> 00:14:54.905
Good morning, sister Lane!

00:14:57.098 --> 00:14:59.254
What are you doing, Candy?

00:15:00.492 --> 00:15:02.224
Making dry leaves!

00:15:14.122 --> 00:15:16.976
Just a little bit more!
Do your best!

00:15:17.011 --> 00:15:17.910
Okay!

00:15:29.061 --> 00:15:31.464
What? The tree is beginning to dry?

00:15:31.499 --> 00:15:33.765
Yes. As you can see...

00:15:34.643 --> 00:15:35.829
What? Move it!

00:15:43.426 --> 00:15:47.096
Now you did it! You damaged its
roots while digging that trench!

00:15:51.515 --> 00:15:55.577
If you take it like this,
it'll dry out soon!

00:16:00.555 --> 00:16:02.990
Please wait, sister Pony!

00:16:03.448 --> 00:16:08.261
We'll make God angry if
we keep quiet about this!

00:16:08.884 --> 00:16:12.238
Even God occasionally turns a blind eye!

00:16:17.134 --> 00:16:19.852
Let's give up on this tree.

00:16:20.418 --> 00:16:21.953
Mr. Flanneman!

00:16:23.161 --> 00:16:26.523
Climbing dry trees isn't my hobby.

00:16:26.558 --> 00:16:28.635
Stop working!

00:16:32.655 --> 00:16:35.542
Mr. Flanneman, banzai!

00:16:35.988 --> 00:16:37.905
Banzai!

00:16:46.828 --> 00:16:51.210
I'm so sorry that the tree
began to dry.

00:16:53.313 --> 00:16:56.832
Mr. Flanneman, there are so
many good trees elsewhere!

00:16:57.346 --> 00:17:00.248
No. I'll never find a tree
like that again.

00:17:03.575 --> 00:17:06.503
Huh? It's starting to rain, isn't it.

00:17:10.613 --> 00:17:16.669
Candy!
Big trouble! If it rains...

00:17:17.799 --> 00:17:19.616
What's the problem?

00:17:19.744 --> 00:17:24.139
No, mr. Flanneman, if you don't
head back soon, you'll get wet!

00:17:25.838 --> 00:17:28.996
I came with a car.
But I don't have an umbrella!

00:17:29.176 --> 00:17:32.424
I'll stay here until the rain stops.

00:18:03.658 --> 00:18:04.966
Mr. Flanneman!

00:18:05.339 --> 00:18:06.489
Mr. Flanneman!

00:18:07.673 --> 00:18:08.943
What's the matter?

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:10.695
The tree...!

00:18:11.133 --> 00:18:12.004
What?

00:18:18.831 --> 00:18:20.518
Wait, mr. Flanneman!

00:18:25.424 --> 00:18:26.671
Please wait!

00:18:26.672 --> 00:18:27.625
Don't touch me!

00:18:31.645 --> 00:18:33.877
This is paint!

00:18:36.566 --> 00:18:39.255
I was tricked!
Deceived by such a child!

00:18:39.682 --> 00:18:41.419
Get to work!

00:18:41.702 --> 00:18:42.774
Begin!

00:18:42.873 --> 00:18:43.712
Yes!

00:18:45.059 --> 00:18:46.401
Mr. Flanneman...

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:50.539
Candy! Do you think I'd
let myself be fooled by you?

00:18:54.196 --> 00:18:58.705
Please stop! I'll apologize for
trying to deceive you... but please...

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.416
I refuse!
No point in trying to stop me now!

00:19:12.678 --> 00:19:14.384
No, no, no!

00:19:14.602 --> 00:19:17.287
You won't take my dad!

00:19:17.619 --> 00:19:19.824
Patty!
You're just...

00:19:19.963 --> 00:19:22.473
Patty!
You were there all along?

00:19:22.508 --> 00:19:25.472
No! I won't let you take my dad!

00:19:25.573 --> 00:19:28.385
Dad?
This tree?

00:19:29.013 --> 00:19:33.684
That's right. Mr. Flanneman,
this tree is our venerable father.

00:19:33.812 --> 00:19:36.788
There are two gentle mothers in Pony's home,

00:19:37.244 --> 00:19:38.254
Candy...

00:19:38.289 --> 00:19:40.577
But there is no father.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:45.096
When we see those two strong branches,
we imagine that they are our father's arms.

00:19:45.131 --> 00:19:49.158
So.. this tree is here
instead of our real fathers.

00:19:49.305 --> 00:19:51.265
That's right!

00:19:56.024 --> 00:19:57.467
Hey, hey!

00:19:58.135 --> 00:19:59.279
That's enough!

00:20:06.751 --> 00:20:09.838
I give up.
Candy, I'll stop the works.

00:20:10.282 --> 00:20:12.087
Mr. Flanneman!

00:20:14.959 --> 00:20:16.137
Thank you!

00:20:18.504 --> 00:20:20.997
Thank you, mr. Flanneman!

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:32.974
If I took the father away from so many kids,
God would have damned me for sure!

00:20:33.045 --> 00:20:35.601
Thank you very much, mr. Flanneman.

00:20:36.078 --> 00:20:40.021
I'll come from time to time
in order to climb this tree!

00:20:41.501 --> 00:20:43.633
We'll be waiting for you.

00:20:43.668 --> 00:20:45.073
Thank you.

00:20:45.217 --> 00:20:49.964
Candy, let's race to the top of the
tree again some time!

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:52.621
I won't lose!

00:20:53.065 --> 00:20:54.964
I won't lose too!

00:20:58.217 --> 00:21:02.043
Farewell, mr. Flanneman!

00:21:02.078 --> 00:21:03.769
Farewell!

00:21:06.264 --> 00:21:10.290
Refreshing wind blew over Pony's hill,

00:21:10.325 --> 00:21:14.769
as if it were bringing springtime
from some faraway place.

00:21:17.245 --> 00:21:20.413
To be continued.
